<title>PORTUGAL: Imperio could invest in Spain-paper.</title>
<headline>Imperio could invest in Spain-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese insurer Imperio could invest between  10 and 24 billion escudos to acquire Spanish insurance companies,  its president Jaime d'Almeida was quoted as saying.</p>
<p>&quot;We have various dossiers, permanently under study, but no decision  has been taken yet,&quot; he told Diario Economico paper.</p>
<p>He gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
